  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To implement commitments of the UN Summit for Refugees and Migrants convened last 19 September 2016, the UN has established a trust fund for the intergovernmental conference and its preparatory process, primarily to support the travel and participation of representatives from developing countries, in particular the least developed countries, and support the preparation of the conference.</narrative>
